                                                "sense_id": "c6694198-ff66-361b-8dd4-bdaf653455d6",
                                                "text": "Gloriosa superba: spectacularly beautiful climbing lily. Roots, stalks, leaves contain an acrid narcotic, superbine, as well as colchicine and choline. Three grains of colchicine are fatal. Hawaii."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
